{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Workflows - Okta Workflow Created, Modified or Exported",
	"Description": "An Okta Workflow, folder, or connection was created, modified, imported, or exported. Workflows run with their connection's authority and can call any API they are connected to, so a new or edited flow is code execution inside your identity provider. Exports also carry the flow's data out of Okta.\n\nEvent types: workflows.user.flow.create, workflows.user.flow.activate, workflows.user.flow.import, workflows.user.flow.export, workflows.user.connection.create, workflows.user.folder.import, workflows.user.folder.export\n\nReference(s):\n- https://help.okta.com/en-us/content/topics/workflows/workflows-main.htm\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/",
	"GUID": "c18e5b93-2f47-4a6d-b0c1-9e37d54a8f62",
